0-bff7ff0ab7d8","call_id":"call_ba4765e2-6a56-41c1-b210-bff7ff0ab7d8","name":"finish","arguments":"{\"summary_en\":\"Please move the cables, rug, shoes and slippers out of the walkthrough today and keep the walking path clear. For construction, a fixed grab bar will be installed beside the toilet, and the door threshold needs a new photo with an A4 sheet on the frame to confirm the size.\",\"summary_zh\":\"請今天將走道的電線、地毯、鞋子和拖鞋移開，保持走道淨空。工程部分將在馬桶旁安裝固定式扶手，門檻需在門框貼上A4紙重拍以確認尺寸。\"}","status":"completed"}]